### Soraeru Auth smoke test (Development)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### 1) Register free user
# @name registerFree
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "displayName": "Tester"
}

### 2) Login free user
# @name loginFree
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 3) Me (free)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFree.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 3b) Complete onboarding
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFree.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "onboardingCompleted": true
}

### 4) Register developer
# @name registerDev
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "larun70@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123",
  "displayName": "Dev1"
}

### 5) Login developer
# @name loginDev
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "larun70@gmail.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 6) Me (developer — isDeveloper=true, unlimited quota)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/me
Authorization: Bearer {{loginDev.response.body.$.accessToken}}

### 7) Google login (replace with a real idToken from Android Sign-In)
# @name loginGoogle
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/google
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "idToken": "PASTE_GOOGLE_ID_TOKEN"
}

### 8) Analyze word (Thai example — multilingual model; any language OK)
# @name analyzeThai
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/word/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFree.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "ขอบคุณ",
  "sourceLanguage": "auto",
  "memoryLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "notationPreference": "bopomofo"
}

### 9) Analyze word (Japanese)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/word/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFree.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "ありがとう",
  "sourceLanguage": "auto",
  "memoryLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "notationPreference": "bopomofo"
}

### 10) Analyze word (English)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/word/analyze
Authorization: Bearer {{loginFree.response.body.$.accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "text": "thank you",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "memoryLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "notationPreference": "roman"
}
